      "writtenOn": "2025-10-15T16:25:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you elaborate on that? Does pujjoga support VBUS measurement through both the TCPC and PPC? And which one we have to use might be different at different times?",
      "parentUuid": "b0b3abf9_04da5e2c",
      "revId": "26a38ec3b26a2ed8a44a27b7d9415deba8f2321a",
